OL,3,GNEWSA'We would find him upset and he
OL,4,Acouldn't tell us why'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor 10-year-old Freddy, life can often
OL,7,Ffeel unmanageable.
OL,9,F"He struggles with eating, food
OL,10,Ftextures, smells, noise, crowds of
OL,11,Fpeople," his mum Amy explained. "He
OL,12,Fgets very overwhelmed."
OL,14,FAmy and Freddy have been taking part in
OL,15,Fa new six-week course in Lancashire
OL,16,Fdesigned to help parents whose children
OL,17,Fhave autism.
OL,19,FIt is part of a major transformation in
OL,20,Fthe way neurodivergence is being
OL,21,Fsupported by the NHS and other
OL,22,Forganisations in the county.
